{"page":384,"verses":[{"verse_key":"27:77","surah":27,"ayah":77,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لَهُدًى وَرَحْمَةٌ لِّلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and it is guidance and grace for those who believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"And indeed, it","transliteration":"wa-innahu","verse_key":"27:77"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُدًۭى","en_gloss":"(is) surely a guidance","transliteration":"lahudan","verse_key":"27:77"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَرَحْمَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"and a mercy","transliteration":"waraḥmatun","verse_key":"27:77"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِّلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"for the believers","transliteration":"lil'mu'minīna","verse_key":"27:77"},{"pos":5,"ar":"٧٧","en_gloss":"(77)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:77"}]},{"verse_key":"27:78","surah":27,"ayah":78,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ رَبَّكَ يَقْضِى بَيْنَهُم بِحُكْمِهِۦ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Truly, your Lord will judge between them in His wisdom- He is the Almighty, the All Knowing-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"27:78"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"27:78"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَقْضِى","en_gloss":"will judge","transliteration":"yaqḍī","verse_key":"27:78"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَيْنَهُم","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"27:78"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِحُكْمِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"by His Judgment","transliteration":"biḥuk'mihi","verse_key":"27:78"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"27:78"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Mighty","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","verse_key":"27:78"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_gloss":"the All-Knower","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","verse_key":"27:78"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٧٨","en_gloss":"(78)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:78"}]},{"verse_key":"27:79","surah":27,"ayah":79,"ar_uthmani":"فَتَوَكَّلْ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ۖ إِنَّكَ عَلَى ٱلْحَقِّ ٱلْمُبِينِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"so [Prophet], put your trust in God, you are on the path of clear truth.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَتَوَكَّلْ","en_gloss":"So put your trust","transliteration":"fatawakkal","verse_key":"27:79"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"27:79"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"27:79"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"indeed, you","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"27:79"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"(are) on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"27:79"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","verse_key":"27:79"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْمُبِينِ","en_gloss":"manifest","transliteration":"l-mubīni","verse_key":"27:79"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٧٩","en_gloss":"(79)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:79"}]},{"verse_key":"27:80","surah":27,"ayah":80,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ لَا تُسْمِعُ ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ وَلَا تُسْمِعُ ٱلصُّمَّ ٱلدُّعَآءَ إِذَا وَلَّوْا۟ مُدْبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You cannot make the dead hear, you cannot make the deaf listen to your call when they turn their backs and leave,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed, you","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"27:80"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(can) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"27:80"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تُسْمِعُ","en_gloss":"cause to hear","transliteration":"tus'miʿu","verse_key":"27:80"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","en_gloss":"the dead","transliteration":"l-mawtā","verse_key":"27:80"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"27:80"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تُسْمِعُ","en_gloss":"can you cause to hear","transliteration":"tus'miʿu","verse_key":"27:80"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلصُّمَّ","en_gloss":"the deaf","transliteration":"l-ṣuma","verse_key":"27:80"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلدُّعَآءَ","en_gloss":"the call","transliteration":"l-duʿāa","verse_key":"27:80"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"27:80"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَّوْا۟","en_gloss":"they turn back","transliteration":"wallaw","verse_key":"27:80"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُدْبِرِينَ","en_gloss":"retreating","transliteration":"mud'birīna","verse_key":"27:80"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨٠","en_gloss":"(80)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:80"}]},{"verse_key":"27:81","surah":27,"ayah":81,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَآ أَنتَ بِهَـٰدِى ٱلْعُمْىِ عَن ضَلَـٰلَتِهِمْ ۖ إِن تُسْمِعُ إِلَّا مَن يُؤْمِنُ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا فَهُم مُّسْلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"you cannot guide the blind out of their error: you cannot make anyone hear you except those who believe in Our signs and submit [to Us].","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"(can) you","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِهَـٰدِى","en_gloss":"guide","transliteration":"bihādī","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْعُمْىِ","en_gloss":"the blind","transliteration":"l-ʿum'yi","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ضَلَـٰلَتِهِمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"their error","transliteration":"ḍalālatihim","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُسْمِعُ","en_gloss":"you can cause to hear","transliteration":"tus'miʿu","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(those) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minu","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","en_gloss":"in Our Signs","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَهُم","en_gloss":"so they","transliteration":"fahum","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مُّسْلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) Muslims","transliteration":"mus'limūna","verse_key":"27:81"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٨١","en_gloss":"(81)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:81"}]},{"verse_key":"27:82","surah":27,"ayah":82,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَإِذَا وَقَعَ ٱلْقَوْلُ عَلَيْهِمْ أَخْرَجْنَا لَهُمْ دَآبَّةً مِّنَ ٱلْأَرْضِ تُكَلِّمُهُمْ أَنَّ ٱلنَّاسَ كَانُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا لَا يُوقِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When the verdict is given against them, We shall bring a creature out of the earth, which will tell them that people had no faith in Our revelations.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَقَعَ","en_gloss":"(is) fulfilled","transliteration":"waqaʿa","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","en_gloss":"the word","transliteration":"l-qawlu","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"against them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَخْرَجْنَا","en_gloss":"We will bring forth","transliteration":"akhrajnā","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":7,"ar":"دَآبَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"a creature","transliteration":"dābbatan","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تُكَلِّمُهُمْ","en_gloss":"speaking to them","transliteration":"tukallimuhum","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsa","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","en_gloss":"of Our Signs","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يُوقِنُونَ","en_gloss":"certain","transliteration":"yūqinūna","verse_key":"27:82"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٨٢","en_gloss":"(82)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:82"}]},{"verse_key":"27:83","surah":27,"ayah":83,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ نَحْشُرُ مِن كُلِّ أُمَّةٍ فَوْجًا مِّمَّن يُكَذِّبُ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا فَهُمْ يُوزَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Day will come when We gather from every community a crowd of those who disbelieved in Our signs and they will be led in separate groups","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"And (the) Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"27:83"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَحْشُرُ","en_gloss":"We will gather","transliteration":"naḥshuru","verse_key":"27:83"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"27:83"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"27:83"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُمَّةٍۢ","en_gloss":"nation","transliteration":"ummatin","verse_key":"27:83"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَوْجًۭا","en_gloss":"a troop","transliteration":"fawjan","verse_key":"27:83"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّمَّن","en_gloss":"of (those) who","transliteration":"mimman","verse_key":"27:83"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُكَذِّبُ","en_gloss":"deny","transliteration":"yukadhibu","verse_key":"27:83"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","en_gloss":"Our Signs","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"27:83"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"fahum","verse_key":"27:83"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُوزَعُونَ","en_gloss":"will be set in rows","transliteration":"yūzaʿūna","verse_key":"27:83"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨٣","en_gloss":"(83)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:83"}]},{"verse_key":"27:84","surah":27,"ayah":84,"ar_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا جَآءُو قَالَ أَكَذَّبْتُم بِـَٔايَـٰتِى وَلَمْ تُحِيطُوا۟ بِهَا عِلْمًا أَمَّاذَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"until, when they come before Him, He will say, ‘Did you deny My messages without even taking them in? Or what were you doing?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"Until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَآءُو","en_gloss":"they come","transliteration":"jāū","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He will say","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَكَذَّبْتُم","en_gloss":"Did you deny","transliteration":"akadhabtum","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِى","en_gloss":"My Signs","transliteration":"biāyātī","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَمْ","en_gloss":"while not","transliteration":"walam","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُحِيطُوا۟","en_gloss":"you encompassed","transliteration":"tuḥīṭū","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِهَا","en_gloss":"them","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عِلْمًا","en_gloss":"(in) knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'man","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَمَّاذَا","en_gloss":"or what","transliteration":"ammādhā","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used (to)","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"27:84"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٨٤","en_gloss":"(84)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:84"}]},{"verse_key":"27:85","surah":27,"ayah":85,"ar_uthmani":"وَوَقَعَ ٱلْقَوْلُ عَلَيْهِم بِمَا ظَلَمُوا۟ فَهُمْ لَا يَنطِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The verdict will be given against them because of their wrongdoing: they will not speak.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَوَقَعَ","en_gloss":"And (will be) fulfilled","transliteration":"wawaqaʿa","verse_key":"27:85"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","en_gloss":"the word","transliteration":"l-qawlu","verse_key":"27:85"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِم","en_gloss":"against them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"27:85"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"27:85"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ظَلَمُوا۟","en_gloss":"they wronged","transliteration":"ẓalamū","verse_key":"27:85"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"fahum","verse_key":"27:85"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(will) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"27:85"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَنطِقُونَ","en_gloss":"speak","transliteration":"yanṭiqūna","verse_key":"27:85"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٨٥","en_gloss":"(85)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:85"}]},{"verse_key":"27:86","surah":27,"ayah":86,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ أَنَّا جَعَلْنَا ٱلَّيْلَ لِيَسْكُنُوا۟ فِيهِ وَٱلنَّهَارَ مُبْصِرًا ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Did they not see that We gave them the night for rest, and the day for light? There truly are signs in this for those who believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرَوْا۟","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"yaraw","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّا","en_gloss":"that We","transliteration":"annā","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"[We] have made","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layla","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِيَسْكُنُوا۟","en_gloss":"that they may rest","transliteration":"liyaskunū","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلنَّهَارَ","en_gloss":"and the day","transliteration":"wal-nahāra","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُبْصِرًا ۚ","en_gloss":"giving visibility","transliteration":"mub'ṣiran","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"27:86"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"surely (are) Signs","trans